WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.200
Jesus said he came to give
his life as a ransom for many.

2
00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:08.020
The Gospels say he rose again
on the first day of the week.

3
00:00:08.070 --> 00:00:13.200
Later, the Book of Acts says, a cloud
took him out of the disciples' sight.

4
00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:16.200
Catholics call these events one mystery.

5
00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:18.760
But how can three events save?

6
00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:22.220
In this mission, you'll learn
what Catholics mean by redemption,

7
00:00:22.270 --> 00:00:24.340
salvation and grace.

8
00:00:24.390 --> 00:00:28.420
Then you'll see what Catholics
mean by sacrifice and new creation,

9
00:00:28.470 --> 00:00:31.000
and why the ascension matters.

10
00:00:31.050 --> 00:00:34.680
Your mission: find out how
Catholics believe a death,

11
00:00:34.730 --> 00:00:37.720
a rising and a going-up can save.
